		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Withered, black-fleshed peat mummy, sacrificed, cursed by blasphemous oaths.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 11, <strong>HP</strong> 15, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 rot touch +3 (1d8 + bog rot), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 3</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Bog Rot</strong>. CON 15+ or 1d4 CON damage and 1d4 DEX damage (can't heal while ill). Repeat check once per day; ends on success. Die at 0 CON or 0 DEX.</p><p></p><p><strong>Drowning Aura</strong>. Air is filled with sodden miasma. All mortals within near of mummy, CON 15+ or begin drowning. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
